      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Árvore Congelada. Durante as estações frias, Snover desce para as partes mais baixas das montanhas e retorna aos picos cobertos de neve na primavera. Curiosos com os humanos, eles se reúnem ao redor de pegadas encontradas na neve.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Snover pode evoluir para Abomasnow no nível 14 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Powder Snow</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Leafage, Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Icy Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Grass Whistle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Mist</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Ice Shard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Ingrain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Wood Hammer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Blizzard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Sheer Cold</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Avalanche, Blizzard, Body Slam, Bullet Seed, Chilling Water, Confide, Curse, Double Team, Double-Edge, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frost Breath, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Hail, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Ice Spinner, Icicle Spear, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magical Leaf, Mega Punch, Mud-Slap, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Shadow Ball, Sleep Talk, Snore, Snowscape, Solar Beam, Substitute, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Water Pulse, Weather Ball, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Avalanche, Bullet Seed, Double-Edge, Growth, Leech Seed, Magical Leaf, Mist, Natural Gift, Seed Bomb, Skull Bash, Stomp, Weather Ball</p>",
